    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silk Soar is a Physics Flinging, Rage Bringing Narrative 2D Platformer (Foddian), where you take on life as a newborn caterpillar attempting to meet the challenges of flinging yourself from the rainforest floor to the top of the canopy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/f6bcecc6a8c5d03829a201a65a91a719.poster.avif?t=1743639911\" width=570 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/f6bcecc6a8c5d03829a201a65a91a719.webm?t=1743639911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your caterpillar around using a catapult-like motion to bounce off walls and flowers, be pushed by the wind, slide across wet leaves and avoid obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/e497b6f32533d9b62404e7de0c42df65.avif?t=1743639911\" width=570 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you reach higher into the canopy you will face more difficult jumps and a variety of obstacles to go further through the layers of the rainforest in search of the top of the canopy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/55c8d50daad4c1c87198b49cac512201.poster.avif?t=1743639911\" width=570 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/55c8d50daad4c1c87198b49cac512201.webm?t=1743639911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the poetic narrative of the struggles of reaching from the depths of darkness in search of freedom and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/aa03828e22cdc08053eba0248582ca23.poster.avif?t=1743639911\" width=570 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/aa03828e22cdc08053eba0248582ca23.webm?t=1743639911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you choose to build your cocoon there is an increasing chance of evolutions affecting your next caterpillar. Will you be a different colour, have a more bouncy body, or have tunnel vision? What combinations will you have and will they help or hinder your next climb?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Silk Soar, every climb can bring you further through the climb you have faced before or challenge you with a combination of evolutions. Will you make it out from the forest floor and into the light or will this climb be cut short as another cocoon in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silk Soar is a Physics Flinging, Rage Bringing Narrative 2D Platformer (Foddian), where you take on life as a newborn caterpillar attempting to meet the challenges of flinging yourself from the rainforest floor to the top of the canopy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/f6bcecc6a8c5d03829a201a65a91a719.poster.avif?t=1743639911\" width=570 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/f6bcecc6a8c5d03829a201a65a91a719.webm?t=1743639911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch your caterpillar around using a catapult-like motion to bounce off walls and flowers, be pushed by the wind, slide across wet leaves and avoid obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/e497b6f32533d9b62404e7de0c42df65.avif?t=1743639911\" width=570 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you reach higher into the canopy you will face more difficult jumps and a variety of obstacles to go further through the layers of the rainforest in search of the top of the canopy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/55c8d50daad4c1c87198b49cac512201.poster.avif?t=1743639911\" width=570 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/55c8d50daad4c1c87198b49cac512201.webm?t=1743639911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the poetic narrative of the struggles of reaching from the depths of darkness in search of freedom and light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/aa03828e22cdc08053eba0248582ca23.poster.avif?t=1743639911\" width=570 height=125 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277320/extras/aa03828e22cdc08053eba0248582ca23.webm?t=1743639911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you choose to build your cocoon there is an increasing chance of evolutions affecting your next caterpillar. Will you be a different colour, have a more bouncy body, or have tunnel vision? What combinations will you have and will they help or hinder your next climb?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Silk Soar, every climb can bring you further through the climb you have faced before or challenge you with a combination of evolutions. Will you make it out from the forest floor and into the light or will this climb be cut short as another cocoon in the darkness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to freedom?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
